      "feedback": "自动测试：14/20。\n用例 M07-01，模式 single，行为不匹配，请检查 SUPPLY_FAN_RUN, TEMP_SETPOINT_ADJUST。\n用例 M07-05，模式 single，行为不匹配，请检查 SUPPLY_FAN_RUN, TEMP_SETPOINT_ADJUST。\n用例 M07-06，模式 single，行为不匹配，请检查 SUPPLY_FAN_RUN, TEMP_SETPOINT_ADJUST。\n用例 M07-07，模式 single，行为不匹配，请检查 SUPPLY_FAN_RUN, TEMP_SETPOINT_ADJUST。\n用例 M07-12，模式 single，行为不匹配，请检查 SUPPLY_FAN_RUN, TEMP_SETPOINT_ADJUST。\n用例 clock-restart-3，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 SUPPLY_FAN_RUN。\nLTL 检查：not_run。",
      "idx": 1,
      "code": "FUNCTION_BLOCK OfficeHVACControl\nVAR_INPUT\n    OCCUPANCY_DETECTED : BOOL;\n    ENERGY_SAVING_MODE : BOOL;\n    HVAC_MODE_SELECTOR : INT;\nEND_VAR\nVAR_OUTPUT\n    SUPPLY_FAN_RUN : BOOL;\n    TEMP_SETPOINT_ADJUST : INT;\nEND_VAR\nVAR\n    TON_30S        : TON;\n    initDone       : BOOL := FALSE;\n    fanCondition   : BOOL;\n    adj            : INT;\nEND_VAR\n\nIF NOT initDone THEN\n    // Power-up initialization: outputs OFF and zero, reset timer\n    SUPPLY_FAN_RUN      := FALSE;\n    TEMP_SETPOINT_ADJUST := 0;\n    TON_30S(IN := FALSE, PT := T#30s);\n    initDone            := TRUE;\nELSE\n    // Normal calculation\n    // --- Supply fan start delay ---\n    // Fan allowed only when occupied and not in Night mode (mode <> 3)\n    fanCondition := OCCUPANCY_DETECTED AND (HVAC_MODE_SELECTOR <> 3);\n    TON_30S(IN := fanCondition, PT := T#30s);\n    SUPPLY_FAN_RUN := TON_30S.Q;\n\n    // --- Temperature setpoint adjustment ---\n    adj := 0;\n    CASE HVAC_MODE_SELECTOR OF\n        0:  // Auto\n            IF OCCUPANCY_DETECTED THEN\n                adj := 0;\n            ELSIF ENERGY_SAVING_MODE THEN\n                adj := 3;\n            ELSE\n                adj := 2;\n            END_IF;\n\n        1:  // Comfort\n            IF OCCUPANCY_DETECTED THEN\n                adj := 0;\n            ELSE\n                adj := 1;\n            END_IF;\n\n        2:  // Economy\n            IF OCCUPANCY_DETECTED THEN\n                adj := 0;\n            ELSE\n                adj := 4;\n            END_IF;\n\n        3:  // Night\n            adj := 4;\n    END_CASE;\n\n    // Clamp to ±4 °C\n    IF adj < -4 THEN\n        adj := -4;\n    ELSIF adj > 4 THEN\n        adj := 4;\n    END_IF;\n    TEMP_SETPOINT_ADJUST := adj;\nEND_IF;\n\nEND_FUNCTION_BLOCK",
